1
00:00:00,007 --> 00:00:01,777
(Amy:)What are you talking about?

2
00:00:01,775 --> 00:00:03,545
(Sheldon:)Oh, there's this company

3
00:00:03,543 --> 00:00:06,073
(Sheldon:)that's attempting
to establish a colony on Mars,

4
00:00:06,079 --> 00:00:08,609
(Sheldon:)and I applied
to be among the first to go.

5
00:00:08,615 --> 00:00:10,385
(Sheldon:)What should
we name him?

6
00:00:10,384 --> 00:00:14,984
(Sheldon:)You know, I came in
thinking "Seth," but...

7
00:00:14,988 --> 00:00:17,618
(Sheldon:)he kind of looks Italian.

8
00:00:17,624 --> 00:00:19,954
(Amy:)You applied for a mission

9
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:22,090
(Amy:)to be a colonist
on another planet,

10
00:00:22,095 --> 00:00:24,165
(Amy:)and couldn't be bothered
to tell me?

11
00:00:26,098 --> 00:00:27,798
(Sheldon:)Would you have approved?

12
00:00:27,801 --> 00:00:29,201
(Amy:)Of course not.

13
00:00:29,202 --> 00:00:31,232
(Sheldon:)Well, based on
your reaction,

14
00:00:31,238 --> 00:00:33,238
(Sheldon:)it looks like I made
the right choice.

15
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:36,340
(Sheldon:)Isn't that right, Giuseppe?

16
00:00:40,446 --> 00:00:42,646
(Leonard:)Hey, hey.

17
00:00:42,649 --> 00:00:45,519
Listen, I-I have a little
confession to make.

18
00:00:45,519 --> 00:00:48,349
(Penny:)Aw, is this your first time?

19
00:00:50,323 --> 00:00:53,163
(Leonard:)No, I got you something
for Valentine's Day,

20
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:55,230
(Leonard:)and I was too embarrassed
to give it to you.

21
00:00:55,228 --> 00:00:56,728
(Penny:)Well, why?

22
00:00:56,730 --> 00:01:00,830
(Leonard:)Well, 'cause I got it
at the dirty store.

